{
  "borough": "Hackney",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;In the absence of insufficient information, the application fails to demonstrate that the proposal would protect site biodiversity or satisfy the statutory requirement to deliver a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;220&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;minimum 10% biodiversity net gain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;. The proposal is therefore contrary to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;293&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Policies G5 and G6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; of the London Plan, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;332&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Policies LP46 and LP47&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; of the Hackney Local Plan 2033, and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;the NPPF 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;In the absence of insufficient information, the application fails to demonstrate the impact of on existing high-quality trees. The proposal therefore fails to safeguard arboricultural assets, contrary to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;398&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Policies G7 and D8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; of the London Plan and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;440&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Policies LP48 and LP41&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 and the NPPF 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
